// BUG REPRO (String summand): the aggregation summand must be a `Long`. Here
// `sum r` adds together `r`, bound to the String field `input.label`. A String
// is not a quantity and cannot be summed at all.
//
// The summand's type was never checked (`collect_declared_binders` records only
// the `for_vars`, and `term_type(Agg)` hard-codes the aggregate to `int`), so a
// non-numeric summand validated cleanly. This should be rejected by the
// temporal type-checker.
//
// Expected: rejected at `validate`.
permit (principal, action == Drupe::Action::"Read", resource)
when temporal {
    exists (n: Long). (
        (sum r for (r: String). where (Drupe::Action::"Charge"::request{ input.label: r })) == n
        && n > 0
    )
};
